 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of checkbox"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for  "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"checkboxes"}]},{"type":"text","text":" objects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOCheckboxItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllCheckboxComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide all tokens to the users."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CheckboxComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"checkboxes"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checkboxes"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SizeSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderRadiusSemanticToken"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BorderWidthSemanticToken"